       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. FILEP.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT CUST-FILE ASSIGN TO 'cust.dat'
               ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-FS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD CUST-FILE.
       01 CUST-REC.
          05 CUST-ID            PIC 9(6).
          05 CUST-NAME          PIC X(30).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       78 MAX-ROWS VALUE 10.
       01 WS-FS                 PIC XX.
       01 WS-PGM                PIC X(8) VALUE 'SUBPROG'.
       01 A-VERY-LONG-DATA-NAME-THAT-EXCEEDS-THIRTY PIC X(5).
       01 TBL.
          05 TBL-ROW OCCURS 10 INDEXED BY TBL-IDX.
             10 CUST-ID         PIC 9(6).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           OPEN INPUT CUST-FILE
           READ CUST-FILE INTO TBL-ROW(1) END-READ
           MOVE CUST-ID OF CUST-REC TO CUST-ID OF TBL-ROW(TBL-IDX)
           SET TBL-IDX TO 1
           MOVE SPACES TO A-VERY-LONG-DATA-NAME-THAT-EXCEEDS-THIRTY
           CALL 'MYPROG' USING WS-FS
           CALL WS-PGM
           CALL 'CBL_OC_DUMP' USING WS-FS
           CLOSE CUST-FILE
           GOBACK.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SECOND.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 S-X PIC X.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       S-PARA.
           DISPLAY S-X GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM SECOND.
